<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-OLS Asia says secures new contracts.</title>
<headline>RTRS-OLS Asia says secures new contracts.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia-listed construction group OLS Asia Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had secured eleven new contracts in its home base of Hong Kong worth HK$87.5 million (US$11.3 million).</p>
<p>The new contracts took work in hand to HK$751 million and represented a 13 percent increase in work in hand since June 30 1996, OLS said.</p>
<p>The contracts included the interior fit-outs of a number of shops and restaurants, as well as the refurbishment of part of a shopping arcade.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
